    "The proxy withheld server stream frames and closed each client connection after independent original-command inspection confirmed commitment; the fixture initiated one invocation per client and did not explicitly resubmit it. Durable counts do not by themselves exclude a hidden duplicate attempt.",
    "Combined unmerged node source and separately built SDK candidates with disposable fixture signer; not hosted CI or an installed distribution.",
    "The totals include earlier fixture commands; this does not cover restart or lost rejection responses. Java emitted existing dependency native-access and deprecated Unsafe warnings."
